  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• <ul>\n• <li>Preheat oven to 220°C/200°C fan-forced.</li>\n• <li>Finely chop brown onion (see ingredients). Finely chop or crush garlic. </li>\n• <li>Roughly chop tomato. </li>\n• <li>Grate carrot. </li>\n• <li>Rinse red lentils.</li>\n• <li>Cut haloumi into 2cm chunks.</li>\n• </ul>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/69bcf44e14877becd77f2406/step-919e6700.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <ul>\n• <li>In a large saucepan, melt the butter and a drizzle of olive oil over medium-high heat.</li>\n• <li>Cook onion, carrot and tomato until softened, 3-4 mins. Add garlic, mild North Indian spice blend, mild curry paste and cook until fragrant, 1-2 mins.</li>\n• <li>Add the water, lentils and coconut milk. Stir to combine. Cover with lid, reduce heat to medium and simmer until lentils are softened, 20-25 mins (add a splash of water if the dhal looks dry).</li>\n• </ul>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/69bcf44e14877becd77f2406/step-c1319610.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <ul>\n• <li>Place flatbreads on lined oven tray. Drizzle each with olive oil and season with the salt. Bake until warmed through, 4-7 mins. </li>\n• <li>Cut flatbread into 2cm strips.</li>\n• <li>In a large frying pan, heat a generous drizzle of olive oil over medium-high heat.</li>\n• <li>When oil is hot, cook haloumi, tossing occasionally, until golden brown, 2-4 mins. </li>\n• </ul>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/69bcf44e14877becd77f2406/step-f2888d20.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <ul>\n• <li>Stir haloumi through dhal before serving. </li>\n• <li>Divide dhal between bowls. Top with Greek-style yoghurt. </li>\n• <li>Serve with flatbread dippers.</li>\n• </ul>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/69bcf44e14877becd77f2406/step-248baa30.jpg"
    }
  ]
